  crumb="Downloads"
  description="Download Core-Geth for Linux, macOS, Windows, Arm or Docker, or build from source. Every release carries a checksum and a build attestation you can verify."
  path="/downloads/"
>
  <PageHero label="Core-Geth downloads" title="Get the Core-Geth client." em="Core-Geth">
    <p class="lede">
      Download a release for Linux, macOS or Windows, run it as a container, or build it from
      source. Every archive and image is published with a checksum and a build attestation, so you
      can confirm what you downloaded before you run it.
    </p>
