      </SectionHead>
      <PlatformTabs legend="Choose your platform" panels={PANELS}>
        <Fragment slot="before-source">
          <p class="panel__note">
            Building needs Go 1.26 or later and a C compiler. Checking out the release tag builds
            the same source the published archives were built from; a binary built from{" "}
            <code>main</code> prints <code>unstable</code> as its release stage until a release is
